    "text": "Killeen\nPolice Seeking New Leads For Killeen Hit & Run Victim\nBy Noah,\n9 hours agoKilleen, Texas Police are asking for support to locate a white BMW that was traveling east on Stagecoach Road on Saturday, June 28th. Authorities believe the vehicle was involved in a hit and run accident where a 20 year old woman was severely injured and needed to be transported to Baylor, Scott and White.",
